{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>這款專為烹飪、健身、親子活動、學習及提升工作效率而設計的計時器應用，透過簡潔的視覺介面與色彩編碼的進度弧形，讓您即使身處房間另一端，也能輕鬆掌握計時狀態。</p>\n\n<h2>清晰視覺化計時</h2>\n<p>應用提供倒數計時器與類比時鐘顯示，支援六個可快速自訂的預設計時器並配有圖示。它具備色彩反饋的視覺進度、最後一分鐘高亮提醒模式，並提供多種鬧鈴聲效與語音播報功能。您亦可透過 iCloud 使用即時遠端計時器，並根據喜好切換亮色、暗色或系統主題。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-493-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-494-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-495-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1260x2736bb-33-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：UltraTimerGo</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T01:25:07.788621+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}